OL,3,GNEWSANorfolk rig worker stuck in Gabon
OL,4,Aafter disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "I don't want the
OL,7,Finvestigation stopped, I don't want
OL,8,Fthings to halt, I don't want to cause a
OL,9,Fscene. I just want my fiance home."
